# SHACL shapes for write-time validation.
#
# Populated during Phase 0 (sanctions pilot first; others land as
# their ETLs are ported in Phase 4). Each shape file targets a
# single class and asserts the constraints the ETL writer must
# satisfy before the triple set can land in the graph.
#
# Naming: shapes/<class-or-domain>.shacl.ttl
